Education card images go in this folder.

  bsc-finance.jpg   -> the BSc Finance card
  cfa-level-1.jpg   -> the CFA Level I card

The filenames must match exactly; the cards probe for these paths and fall
back to the "drop image" placeholder until the file loads. Square-ish images
work best. Nothing is cropped — the card scales the image to fit inside its
panel — so a portrait certificate scan is safe, it will just sit letterboxed.

To change a filename or add a card, edit `image:` in lib/content.ts.
